Template: deadbolt/purge-quarantine
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Delete the quarantine folder too?
 Purging Deadbolt removes its settings, history, incident records and logs.
 The quarantine folder, /var/lib/deadbolt/quarantine, holds files Deadbolt
 moved out of the way. They are stored scrambled and cannot run.
 .
 Say no to keep them, for example if you might restore one later.
